  "title": "3 mm LED",
  "summary": "Round 3 mm (T-1) through-hole LED, two leads on 2.54 mm. The longer lead is the anode, and the flat on the rim marks the cathode. Pick its color: red, yellow, green, blue or white. Red, yellow and green are diffused; blue and white are water clear. Red, yellow, blue and white warn above 30 mA, green above 25 mA. Red and yellow warn above 75 mW, green above 62.5 mW, and blue and white above 120 mW.",
  "tags": ["led", "light", "indicator", "through-hole"],
